{[%evp 0,1,29999,-30000]} {[#]} 1. Nf7# {Smothered mate is a common method of
checkmating. It occurs when a knight checkmates a king that is smothered 
(surrounded) by his friendly pieces and he has nowhere to move nor is there
any way to capture the knight. It is also known as Philidor's Legacy after
François-André Danican Philidor , though its documentation predates Philidor
by several hundred years} *

